            "content": "# PRODUCT BACKLOG - PROJECT TEMPLATE\n\n## 1. PROJECT INFORMATION\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **PRODUCT / PROJECT NAME** | `<Project Name>` |\n| **KEY PO** | `<Product Owner Name>` |\n| **DIVISION** | `<Division / Department>` |\n| **DOMAIN** | `<Business Domain>` |\n| **Overview** | `<Project Overview>` |\n| **Deployment Scope** | `<Deployment Scope>` |\n| **PLATFORM** | `<Platform / Tech Stack>` |\n| **Staging Link** | `<Staging Environment URL>` |\n| **Production Link** | `<Production Environment URL>` |\n\n---\n\n## 2. ROADMAP\n\n> *(Define the overall roadmap by phase / milestone here)*\n\n```\nPhase 1: [Description] - [Timeline]\nPhase 2: [Description] - [Timeline]\nPhase 3: [Description] - [Timeline]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. PRODUCT BACKLOG\n\n| NO. | REQUEST DATE | EPICS / ITEMS | MODULE / FEATURE | USER STORY / DESCRIPTION | PRIORITY | SPRINT BACKLOG / VERSION | STATUS | PO | RELEASE DATE | NOTES |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `YYYY-MM-DD` | `<Epic>` | `<Module>` | `<User Story Description>` | `2-Medium` | Sprint 1 | Not Started | `<PO>` | `YYYY-MM-DD` | |\n| 2 | | | | | | | | | | |\n| 3 | | | | | | | | | | |\n\n**PRIORITY legend:**\n- `4-Critical` - Urgent interrupt request, must be executed immediately (executive directive)\n- `3-High` - Must have: key functionality required within the Sprint\n- `2-Medium` - Should have: important but not urgent; solution remains viable without it\n- `1-Low` - Could have: desired but not essential\n\n**STATUS legend:**\n- `Not Started` / `In Progress` / `Done` / `Blocked` / `Cancelled`\n\n---\n\n*Generated by Senior PM Skill - ISC Project Management Framework*\n"
